		line=939,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll only stand out more if you act so self-consciously.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Kanami hesitantly trails off in response.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“C'mere, get in closer.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“We cannot, Onii-sama... People will notice.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It'll be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"Kanami and I walk the streets side by side.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Well on its road to democracy, Imperials and Republicans can be seen intermingling everywhere throughout the streets of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“O-Onii-sama, your hand...”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Our bodies are nestled right against each other, and I even have my hand around her waist.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"I'm not trying to embarrass her─it's an essential part of our cover.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"If we act completely as normal, passersby might notice that Kanami's conduct is awfully similar to Empress\nHisui's.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, can you get closer?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“E-Even closer?!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ooh... If you insist. I shall try my best!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"After briefly steeling herself, Kanami proceeds to cling to me even more tightly.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She's trembling from head to toe with embarrassment, but even still, she refuses to let go.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a little bit ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"too",
{"/font"},
" close.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-I am sorry, Onii-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Kanami immediately separates herself from me.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"We continue walking, this time at a comfortably close distance to each other.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"To all the passersby, we probably look like just another ordinary couple.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Nobody would ever think that the girl beside me is actually Empress Hisui of all people.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are things going to be fine in the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ever since I woke up, I've been feeling under the weather. Hence, I decided to rest in my room for the rest of the day.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I made sure to impress upon the servants that I was not to be disturbed under any circumstance, so we have nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What an irresponsible Empress you are.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Well, my Onii-sama is just as irresponsible for being complicit.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"She playfully replies, nestling herself once again next to me.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Our outing today is an entirely unsanctioned one.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Kanami said she had somewhere she wanted to go, so I whisked her away from the palace.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Elsa was reluctant, but gave in after much persuading.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"The fact that preparations to abolish the Imperial institution are proceeding smoothly likely influenced her decision.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"As a result of this progress, there isn't as much need to constantly cloister Kanami away in the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I bet the people would be jealous if they knew I got to have Empress Hisui all to myself.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehee, what an irresponsible Onii-sama I have indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Kanami retorts with a mischievous giggle.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"She seems to be greatly enjoying the thrill of this extraordinary situation.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, where do you want to go today?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Kanami has toured the city many times as Empress Hisui.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"However, there must still be many places she's not yet seen.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Um.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Kanami's smile vanishes, replaced by a mysterious expression.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"She turns to face towards the direction of the former Warrior District.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"The two of us arrive at the site of the ruins.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Reconstruction is proceeding little by little, but it will be a long time yet before it is restored to its former glory.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"We come to a stop at the spot where House Tokita once stood.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have always wished to come here with you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Kanami lays a bouquet of flowers within the ruins of the manor.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"She and I close our eyes and offer a slient prayer.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Even now, hardly any memories of my adoptive parents have returned to me.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Dearest Father, Mother, I must apologize.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have been a most unfaithful child.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I failed in my duty as a daughter to a warrior's family, and even now, I deceive the people as a false Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I humbly beg your forgiveness.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I lay a hand on Kanami's shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're doing all that you can.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure they would forgive you.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Thank you for saying that, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Kanami wanders around the ruins of the manor, searching for the traces of our bygone days.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Everything is still unfamiliar to me, and so, she tells me story upon story of our past.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“This here was my room, and that there was your room.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You used to play with me all the time in this courtyard right here.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What games did we play?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“We mostly played house when we were kids.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I was the mother, and you were the father.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Siblings playing at being a married couple?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Is that not quite like what we are doing, even now?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, true enough.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have always dreamed of marrying you, Onii-sama, ever since then.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Even now, I have not given up on that dream.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami wishes to be her Onii-sama's bride.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Kanami looks up at me with eyes brimming with passion.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"The next moment, however, she lets out a small laugh to break the tension.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehehee, if we were to get married, Hotori-chan and the rest of our friends would definitely find out about our relationship, wouldn't they?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, Onii-sama. Please think of it as a joke and forget I ever said anything.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Kanami isn't wrong. It would be bad news if anyone were to find out that our relationship goes far beyond that of brother and sister.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Even so, the very prospect of marrying Kanami is hopelessly irresistible to me.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we're gonna get married, it'll have to be after they announce the abolition of the Imperial system.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As things stand right now, it'll be hard for us to be wed publicly.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Kanami bats her eyelashes in confusion.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Perhaps I should have made my point even clearer.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm saying I'm definitely going to marry you, someday.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Fwuh? ...Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Kanami covers her mouth with both her hands.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Moved to tears, her limpid eyes slowly pool over with moisture.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“T-Truly?!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. I swear it.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Kanami takes my hand into hers.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"To convey the depth of my resolve, I gently squeeze that very warm, very precious hand with my own.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I wonder what our friends would say if they knew we plan to get married.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I might get smacked a few times.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Laying hands on his own sister is not conduct befitting a respectable man.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But no matter what it takes, I'll get them to approve of us.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"I squeeze Kanami's hand even tighter.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I will always love you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...To think that you would make my childhood dream finally come true.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're getting ahead of yourself, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"At the very least, our marriage will have to wait until the Empire has successfully democratized.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"The Empire is still in the process of being reborn; we can't afford to jeopardize that with a sudden announcement of Empress Hisui's marriage.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I'll always love you too, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"Amid the stillness of the ruins, with only the quiet sound of the wind for company, I embrace my future bride-to-be.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"She gently flutters her eyelids shut.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"And so, we confirm our feelings with a tender kiss.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nhm... mwah... nmm... fwah...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hah... haah, haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"When we part our lips, I find myself staring into Kanami's breathless expression.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We still have plenty of time.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is there anywhere you want to go today?”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"We were told only to be back to the Imperial Palace by evening.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami cares not where she is, so long as she is by her Onii-sama's side.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Kanami lovingly murmurs as she nuzzles her cheek against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sure you don't have anywhere in mind? I'll take you wherever you want to go.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“In that case, may we go up to your room?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Kanami peers up into my eyes, an amorous blush crossing her face.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Within my arms, I can feel her petite body steadily growing warmer and warmer.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Yeah, let's head back to my room.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Even if we don't put it into words, we each know what the other desires.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have not been in your room ever since that day.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"As soon as we arrive, Kanami whispers this to me with a passionate gaze.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"“That day” was the day I stole her away from the Government-General, the single, precious day we were able to spend together as brother and sister.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"The day we first made love together.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll go put on some tea. Go ahead and sit wherever─”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please wait, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Kanami grabs onto my sleeve.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Refusing to meet my gaze, she fidgets in place with a lonesome look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Um, I noticed... your futon is already laid out.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Only when she mentions it do I realize that I left my futon out.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I was busy this morning, so I must've forgotten to put it away.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"It almost looks as though I planned to bring Kanami back here from the very beginning.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“When you promised you would marry me, I fell in love with you all over again.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“These feelings of mine... wish for you to answer them right away.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Without any hesitation, Kanami buries herself in my chest.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"My reason quickly begins to fall apart in the face of her enticement.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Until a sudden knock on the door interrupts us.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I hastily put some distance between me and her.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Sorry, Soujin-kun, can you help me out for a little while?”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, I'll be right down.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'm sorry for interrupting your time together, really!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"With that, the manager heads back downstairs.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Mmmrgh...”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Kanami sulkily puffs out her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Are you really going to go?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be right back, so be a good girl and wait for me.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...I understand. Only because you said so.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Despite the sweet sorrow in Kanami's eyes, I reluctantly part with her and head down to the shop.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"The flower shop happened to be innundated by a sudden influx of highly detailed orders, and filling them takes much longer than I expected.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Even though I had no choice, I still feel guilty towards Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"...Maybe I should've brought her back some sweets.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"As I ponder how to best apologize, I return to my room where Kanami should be waiting for me.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(...Hmm?)”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I notice an out of the ordinary strangeness about the room as soon as I slide the door open just a crack.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The tranquil stillness I expected is instead punctuated by tiny, wistful sighs.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"When I peek into the room, I spot Kanami curled up on my futon.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"For a second, I wonder if she's asleep, but that's clearly not the case.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“This is... the futon Onii-sama sleeps in every night...”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"She's rubbing her cheek right against it.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“*Sniff...* Haah... *Sniff...*”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nnh... nnhh... Onii-sama ought to be coming back any minute now...”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But... it's all Onii-sama's fault... Making me wait for so long...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I cannot... hold myself back...”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"I silently close the door behind me and loom down over her.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've been a bad girl, Kanami. I told you to be good and wait for me.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“O-Onii-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Still splayed out over my futon, Kanami tries to leap to her feet in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"But she soon settles down once I place a firm hand on her hips.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“S-Since when...?!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just now.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“More imporantly, Kanami, what were you doing just now?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Kanami shamefully buries her face in my pillow and answers me in a hesitating whisper.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ooooh... I'm sorry, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“As soon as I smelled your scent on your futon... I just could not stop myself...”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Kanami shrinks even smaller into herself as tears pool up within her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami has already had to wait so long to feel her\nOnii-sama's touch.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“She wanted you to make love to her... so badly...”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Her shoulders lightly tremble as the teardrops finally roll down her cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't cry now. I'm not blaming you.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nnh... *Sniff... sniff, sniff...*”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"My words don't seem to have any effect on her.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you... hate me now?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you really mean it?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Can I take it from here?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"I whisper in her ear as I stroke her soft hair.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“P-Please...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am already more than prepared.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Kanami turns to face me with her dreamy, half-vacant eyes.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama... You are going to marry me, right? You absolutely have to...”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, absolutely.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Kanami smiles with blissful contentment as I softly pat her head.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"The abolition of the Imperial system is just around the corner.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"The two of us will soon be able to love each other openly without any reservation.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“*Sniff...*”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...Are you still crying?”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I-I apologize... I am just so happy.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami is just so, so happy that she can be her beloved Onii-sama's bride.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For so many years, it was just make-believe, but it is now finally becoming a reality.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah... It's been a long time coming.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehehee, all of your Kanami truly belongs to you now, does she not?”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll have to change the way you refer to me, in that case.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"After all, it's not normal by any stretch of the imagination to have a bride who refers to her groom as her brother.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"But at this, Kanami makes a terribly forlorn face.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“No way... You are intending to stop being my Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Well, if we get married, we'll no longer be brother and sister, but man and wife.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I won't accept that...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I wish to remain as your sister even while becoming your bride.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The only thing your Kanami desires is for her Onii-sama to remain as her Onii-sama, forever and always.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...I don't even know what's going on anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehee, then you would not mind if things stayed as they are?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Kanami snuggles up close to me.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami will never, ever let you go.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“So please... please never let go of her either, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Please, stay with me forever and ever.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. We'll be together, forever.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Unprompted, the two of us seek out each other's lips.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Nnm... nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"For now, our improprietous affair is one that must remain hidden in the shadows.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"But the day will soon come when I can proudly reveal my ardent love for my sister and my bride to the radiant light of day.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
